.trylo/
# settings 五层加载的 project 层夹具需要一个真实的 `.trylo/` 工程目录；上面的
# 运行时状态规则会连它一起吞掉，导致已提交的 settings-fs.test.ts 在干净树上必红
# （CLI-01A F2-6）。只放行这一个夹具目录，运行时的 `.trylo/` 仍然被忽略。
!testdata/settings/fs/workspace/.trylo/
tmp/
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The PTY sidecar's cargo build directory (WP06). 439 files and ~95 MB of
# compiler output that `cargo build --release --offline` regenerates from
# vendor-bin/pty/src/main.rs. It was previously untracked only because nothing had
# run `git add` on it — a comment in PROVENANCE.json saying "not committed" is a
# claim, not a mechanism, and `git add vendor-bin` would have taken all of it.
# The staged artifact lives in vendor-bin/pty/<platform>-<arch>/ and is committed
# on purpose, with its sha256 in PROVENANCE.json; this rule excludes only the
# build tree above it.
vendor-bin/pty/target/
